### Create an experiment (201 Created)
# @name createExperiment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/experiments
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Test Experiment"
}

### Fetch the created experiment (200 OK)
GET {{createExperiment.response.headers.Location}}

### Unknown experiment (404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/experiments/0

### Reject a blank name (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/experiments
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": ""
}
